    <entry>
      <title>Django 中的 HTTP 响应（Response）</title>
      <link href="/2024/02/26/Django-Response/"/>
      <url>/2024/02/26/Django-Response/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Django-中的-HTTP-响应（Response）"><a href="#Django-中的-HTTP-响应（Response）" class="headerlink" title="Django 中的 HTTP 响应（Response）"></a>Django 中的 HTTP 响应（Response）</h1><p>在 Django 中，HTTP 响应是服务器端向客户端发送的数据。它包含了一些元数据和内容，用于告知客户端请求的状态以及提供相应的数据。Django 提供了多种方式来创建和处理 HTTP 响应。</p><h2 id="HttpResponse-类"><a href="#HttpResponse-类" class="headerlink" title="HttpResponse 类"></a>HttpResponse 类</h2><p>Django 中最基本的响应类是 <code>HttpResponse</code>。它允许你返回简单的文本内容。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.http <span class="keyword">import</span> HttpResponse</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">my_view</span>(<span class="params">request</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> HttpResponse(<span class="string">&quot;Hello, world!&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="渲染模板"><a href="#渲染模板" class="headerlink" title="渲染模板"></a>渲染模板</h2><p>除了返回简单的文本外，你还可以渲染模板并将其作为响应返回。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.shortcuts <span class="keyword">import</span> render</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">my_view</span>(<span class="params">request</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> render(request, <span class="string">&#x27;my_template.html&#x27;</span>, &#123;<span class="string">&#x27;foo&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;bar&#x27;</span>&#125;)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="JsonResponse-类"><a href="#JsonResponse-类" class="headerlink" title="JsonResponse 类"></a>JsonResponse 类</h2><p>如果你需要返回 JSON 格式的数据，可以使用 <code>JsonResponse</code> 类。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.http <span class="keyword">import</span> JsonResponse</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">my_view</span>(<span class="params">request</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    data = &#123;<span class="string">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> JsonResponse(data)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="HttpResponseRedirect-类"><a href="#HttpResponseRedirect-类" class="headerlink" title="HttpResponseRedirect 类"></a>HttpResponseRedirect 类</h2><p>当你需要重定向用户到另一个页面时，可以使用 <code>HttpResponseRedirect</code> 类。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.http <span class="keyword">import</span> HttpResponseRedirect</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.urls <span class="keyword">import</span> reverse</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">my_view</span>(<span class="params">request</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 重定向到 &#x27;some/url/&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> HttpResponseRedirect(reverse(<span class="string">&#x27;some-url&#x27;</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="FileResponse-类"><a href="#FileResponse-类" class="headerlink" title="FileResponse 类"></a>FileResponse 类</h2><p>如果需要返回文件作为响应，可以使用 <code>FileResponse</code> 类。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> django.http <span class="keyword">import</span> FileResponse</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> os</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">download_file</span>(<span class="params">request</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    file_path = <span class="string">&#x27;/path/to/file.txt&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">    file_name = os.path.basename(file_path)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> FileResponse(<span class="built_in">open</span>(file_path, <span class="string">&#x27;rb&#x27;</span>), as_attachment=<span class="literal">True</span>, filename=file_name)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>以上是 Django 中常见的一些响应类和用法。根据你的需求选择合适的响应类来返回数据给客户端。</p>]]></content>
      
      
